<title>USA: Forcenergy plans $175 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Forcenergy plans $175 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forcenergy Inc said Thursday it intends to offer $175 million of senior subordinated notes due 2007.</p>
<p>The offering will be made to institutional buyers, and the company expects it to begin during the week of February 10.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to repay outstanding loans under the company's revolving credit facility.</p>
</text>
